\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Species count per training-image bin, before and after the i003 per-species cap at $500$. The cap collapses the two heaviest bins ($\le $1k and $>$1k) into the $\le $500 bin and lifts middle bins, but does not move species out of the long tail (left bins). Section~\ref {sec:cap_extra} reports the corresponding leaderboard outcome: this flatter distribution \emph  {hurt} the public Macro F1.}}{6}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:long_tail}{{4}{6}{Species count per training-image bin, before and after the i003 per-species cap at $500$. The cap collapses the two heaviest bins ($\le $1k and $>$1k) into the $\le $500 bin and lifts middle bins, but does not move species out of the long tail (left bins). Section~\ref {sec:cap_extra} reports the corresponding leaderboard outcome: this flatter distribution \emph {hurt} the public Macro F1}{figure.4}{}}
